  id: CruelMurder
  title: Cruel Murder
  author: BigCrunch22
  description: "\"This module is powered by the relentless soul of a murder victim.
    The only way to set it free is to solve the case so the victim can finally move
    on to the afterlife. Many before you have tried to connect the dots, and they
    all failed. Will you fare better than them?\"\r\n\r\nImplementor - BigCrunch22\r\n\nTP
    Supported!\r\n\r\nIf someone wants to add TP Support/Logging/Anything useful,
    you have my approval for that.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\n\n[i][b]Note:
    [/b] The module utilized [b]Gemini[/b] a great amount during creation, especially
    with the puzzle generator.[/i]"
